            "detailed_description": "<h1>Edição especial</h1><p>Purchase the <strong>MXGP2 - Special Edition</strong> and get the Full Game, the Season Pass with 3 additional contents!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MXGP2 - The Official Motocross Videogame</strong></h2> is the evolution of the previous Milestone’s Motocross game MXGP. The game is based on the 2015 FIM Motocross World Championship license.<br>Easy to enjoy and fully realistic!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>THE OFFICIAL MOTOCROSS VIDEOGAME</strong><br>Official license, bikes, rosters and tracks are the core elements of the game, but that’s not enough, something needs to be added: your heart. Be ready to live in the HEART of MOTOCROSS! <br><br></li><li><strong>THE COMPLETE ROSTER OF 2015 SEASON</strong><br>Start the challenge riding with the complete roster of the official Championship of MXGP and MX2.<br><br></li><li><strong>ALL THE OFFICIAL CHAMPIONSHIP TRACKS</strong><br>In MXGP2 you’ll have the chance to ride on 18 official tracks from the 2015 FIM Motocross World Championship, to live the amazing experience of MXoN and to scrub in the made-up indoor circuits.<br><br></li><li><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BIKE AND RIDER</strong><br>What about creating your own personal team? With MXGP2  you can choose the name and logo for your team, buy your favorite bikes, custom liveries and accessories for your bike and rider. Enjoy changing the performance of your two wheels. The challenge begins here!<br><br></li><li><strong>MXoN</strong><br>Enjoy the new MXoN game mode: choose a nation and ride with all its representatives in turn!<br><br></li><li><strong>ACCURATE PHYSICS</strong><br>Physical terrain deformation of the tracks has been improved, the graphic is better than ever and the implementation of a new bike handling and a revised aerial behaviour will assure you an unexpected level of realism!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MXGP2 - The Official Motocross Videogame</strong></h2> is the evolution of the previous Milestone’s Motocross game MXGP. The game is based on the 2015 FIM Motocross World Championship license.<br>Easy to enjoy and fully realistic!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>THE OFFICIAL MOTOCROSS VIDEOGAME</strong><br>Official license, bikes, rosters and tracks are the core elements of the game, but that’s not enough, something needs to be added: your heart. Be ready to live in the HEART of MOTOCROSS! <br><br></li><li><strong>THE COMPLETE ROSTER OF 2015 SEASON</strong><br>Start the challenge riding with the complete roster of the official Championship of MXGP and MX2.<br><br></li><li><strong>ALL THE OFFICIAL CHAMPIONSHIP TRACKS</strong><br>In MXGP2 you’ll have the chance to ride on 18 official tracks from the 2015 FIM Motocross World Championship, to live the amazing experience of MXoN and to scrub in the made-up indoor circuits.<br><br></li><li><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BIKE AND RIDER</strong><br>What about creating your own personal team? With MXGP2  you can choose the name and logo for your team, buy your favorite bikes, custom liveries and accessories for your bike and rider. Enjoy changing the performance of your two wheels. The challenge begins here!<br><br></li><li><strong>MXoN</strong><br>Enjoy the new MXoN game mode: choose a nation and ride with all its representatives in turn!<br><br></li><li><strong>ACCURATE PHYSICS</strong><br>Physical terrain deformation of the tracks has been improved, the graphic is better than ever and the implementation of a new bike handling and a revised aerial behaviour will assure you an unexpected level of realism!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "MXGP2 - The Official Motocross Videogame is the evolution of the previous Milestone’s Motocross game MXGP. The game is based on the 2015 FIM Motocross World Championship license.",
