                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows®Vista SP2 / Windows® 7 SP1 / Windows® 8 / Windows® 8.1<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i5 2500K 3.3GHz / AMD Phenom II X4 850<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> GeForce GT 640 / Radeon HD 6670  1GB*<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 10<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 20 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> *Laptop versions of graphics cards may work but are not officially supported.</li></ul>",
